					© 2010 Google Corporation et © 2012 Red Hat, Inc., licence
					<a href="https://openfontlicense.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SIL Open Font License 1.1</a>.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Publicités</strong>&nbsp;: Google Mobile Ads Unity Plugin, © 2013 Google Inc., licence
					<a href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apache 2.0</a>.
				</li>
